  )
  (text "VIN uses AON_5V. BEFORE external VIN plus USB: cut the Teensy VUSB-VIN link exactly as PJRC documents.\nUSB is the module device port to the Jetson. No second USB power feed may enter VIN.\n3V3 output budget is 250 mA per PJRC; both feet have their own 5 V-fed regulators."
    (at 15 24 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "16712401-c272-5879-9678-5476db3dc0e4")
  )
